{"file": "D:\\SpaceBook\\Books\\8th\\8th MAths\\JPG\\021.jpg", "lines": [{"text": "Example 3:", "conf": 0.851, "box": [[97, 61], [165, 55], [167, 72], [99, 78]]}, {"text": "One kg of dates costs Rs 443.75. Find the cost of 17kg of dates.", "conf": 0.928, "box": [[97, 82], [459, 54], [461, 74], [99, 103]]}, {"text": "Solution:", "conf": 0.813, "box": [[98, 108], [156, 104], [157, 122], [99, 126]]}, {"text": "Cost of 1kg of dates", "conf": 0.838, "box": [[97, 131], [221, 122], [222, 141], [98, 150]]}, {"text": "=Rs 443.75", "conf": 0.835, "box": [[234, 123], [314, 115], [315, 133], [236, 140]]}, {"text": "Cost of17kg of dates=Rs443.75×17", "conf": 0.906, "box": [[97, 150], [345, 133], [346, 153], [98, 169]]}, {"text": "=Rs 7543.75", "conf": 0.852, "box": [[236, 164], [323, 156], [324, 174], [238, 181]]}, {"text": "Thus, 17 kg of dates cost Rs 7543.75.", "conf": 0.924, "box": [[98, 194], [308, 181], [309, 200], [99, 213]]}, {"text": "Example 4:", "conf": 0.852, "box": [[95, 225], [168, 221], [169, 241], [96, 245]]}, {"text": "For iftar, Sania prepared 6.4 litres oforange juice. If shepoured it into 8 jugs", "conf": 0.87, "box": [[94, 248], [539, 224], [540, 246], [95, 270]]}, {"text": "equally, how much juice is poured in each jug?", "conf": 0.908, "box": [[94, 269], [366, 255], [367, 274], [95, 288]]}, {"text": "Solution:", "conf": 0.895, "box": [[94, 295], [156, 292], [157, 309], [95, 312]]}, {"text": "Total litres oforange juice = 6.4litres", "conf": 0.9, "box": [[95, 317], [322, 308], [323, 330], [96, 339]]}, {"text": "Numberof jugs", "conf": 0.849, "box": [[96, 338], [192, 336], [193, 353], [96, 355]]}, {"text": "=8", "conf": 0.525, "box": [[253, 334], [283, 332], [284, 350], [255, 353]]}, {"text": "Each jug can hold", "conf": 0.912, "box": [[95, 358], [204, 353], [205, 373], [96, 378]]}, {"text": "= 6.4+8", "conf": 0.684, "box": [[253, 358], [317, 355], [318, 372], [254, 375]]}, {"text": "64 +8", "conf": 0.758, "box": [[272, 372], [323, 381], [318, 405], [267, 395]]}, {"text": "10", "conf": 0.582, "box": [[274, 396], [295, 396], [295, 413], [274, 413]]}, {"text": "64 ×1", "conf": 0.689, "box": [[273, 415], [325, 415], [325, 436], [273, 436]]}, {"text": "10", "conf": 0.645, "box": [[275, 435], [299, 435], [299, 452], [275, 452]]}, {"text": "10", "conf": 0.63, "box": [[275, 472], [295, 472], [295, 490], [275, 490]]}, {"text": "= 0.8 litre", "conf": 0.775, "box": [[257, 535], [322, 535], [322, 552], [257, 552]]}, {"text": "So, 0.8 litre of juice is poured in each jug.", "conf": 0.908, "box": [[95, 563], [342, 557], [342, 576], [96, 582]]}, {"text": "Exercise 2.2", "conf": 0.913, "box": [[324, 614], [416, 610], [417, 630], [325, 634]]}, {"text": "Saafi bought3litresof mangojuiceand2litresoforangejuice.", "conf": 0.916, "box": [[124, 668], [544, 656], [544, 681], [125, 693]]}, {"text": "How much more mango juice did he buy than orange juice?", "conf": 0.943, "box": [[128, 693], [503, 683], [504, 705], [128, 715]]}, {"text": "Adeelabought6packets of dates for Ramadan.If the mass of one", "conf": 0.886, "box": [[129, 728], [544, 718], [544, 737], [129, 747]]}, {"text": "packet is3kg,find the total mass of dates shebought.", "conf": 0.87, "box": [[131, 749], [484, 743], [484, 765], [132, 771]]}, {"text": "NOFOSAH", "conf": 0.687, "box": [[77, 774], [165, 774], [165, 788], [77, 788]]}, {"text": "17", "conf": 0.665, "box": [[317, 777], [346, 777], [346, 801], [317, 801]]}]}